  <name>Qrious</name>
  <summary>Generate QR codes for WiFi, contacts, URLs, emails, and more</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.samwell9854">
    <name>Samuel Giroux</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>Qrious is a simple and fast QR code generator. Choose a format, fill in the fields, and watch a QR code and its raw encoded payload update live as you type.</p>
    <p>Save the generated image as a PNG or copy it to the clipboard to share it anywhere. The window adapts from a two-column layout when wide to a single column when narrow.</p>
    <p>Supported formats:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>WiFi networks</li>
      <li>Contact information as vCards</li>
      <li>URLs</li>
      <li>Email addresses</li>
      <li>Phone numbers</li>
      <li>Plain text</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
